#: proj3-extensions.md:1
msgid "Ising model: Possible project extensions"
msgstr "Ising Model：発展課題の提案"

#: proj3-extensions.md:3
msgid ""
"In the example project each of the spins interacts with the magnetic field "
"and its four nearest neighbours. In other words, spin $s_{i,j}$ interacts "
"with spins $s_{i-1,j}$, $s_{i+1,j}$, $s_{i,j-1}$ and $s_{i,j+1}$ and the "
"external magnetic field. To extend this idea you can study a system of spins"
" where the pattern of interactions is different. For example, you might have"
" spin $s_{i,j}$ only interact with spins $s_{i-1,j}$ and $s_{i+1,j}$ or you "
"could extend the range of interactions to the second nearest neighbours so "
"spin $s_{i,j}$ starts interacting with spins like $s_{i,j-2}$, $s_{i,j+2}$ "
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"課題例では、各 Spin が磁場と4つの Nearest Neighbours に相互作用する。つまり、$s_{i,j}$ は "
"$s_{i-1,j}$、$s_{i+1,j}$、$s_{i,j-1}$、$s_{i,j+1}$、および外部磁場と相互作用する。発展課題では、この組み合わせを変えてみる。例えば、$s_{i,j}$"
" を $s_{i-1,j}$ と $s_{i+1,j}$ のみと相互作用させてもよい。また、相互作用を Second-nearest "
"Neighbours まで広げ、$s_{i,j}$ を $s_{i,j-2}$、$s_{i,j+2}$ などとも相互作用させられる。"

#: proj3-extensions.md:9
msgid ""
"If you want to be even more ambitious you could investigate systems of spins"
" that sit on a non-square lattice. If the spin $s_{i,j}$ interacts more "
"weakly with spins $s_{i-1,j}$ and $s_{i+1,j}$ than with spins $s_{i,j-1}$ "
"and $s_{i,j+1}$ then the spins are sat on a rectangular lattice in which the"
" $j$ direction is shorter than the $i$ direction. However, there are even "
"more exotic lattice options than this. You can, for instance, have the spins"
" sit on a triangular lattice or a hexagonal lattice."
msgstr ""
"さらに意欲があれば、Square Lattice 以外に Spin を置くことも調べられる。$s_{i,j}$ と "
"$s_{i-1,j}$・$s_{i+1,j}$ との相互作用が、$s_{i,j-1}$・$s_{i,j+1}$ との相互作用より弱ければ、$j$ 方向が"
" $i$ 方向より短い Rectangular Lattice に相当する。さらに、Triangular Lattice や Hexagonal "
"Lattice なども考えられる。"

#: proj3-extensions.md:15
msgid ""
"If you write a report that describes simulations that you have done to "
"investigate the beahviour of the magnetisation for a system of Ising spins "
"please include a figure that illustrates how the spins interact as I have "
"done in my example report."
msgstr ""
"Ising Spins 系の Magnetisation のシミュレーションについてレポートを書く場合は、著者のレポート例のように、Spins "
"の相互作用の仕方を示す図を含めること。"
